OL,3,GNEWSANone of UK government's #2.5bn    
OL,4,Asteel package spent in Wales, figures  
OL,5,Ashow                                   
OL,7,FWales has not received any money from  
OL,8,Fthe UK government's #2.5bn steel       
OL,9,Findustry investment plan announced in  
OL,10,FFebruary 2025, according to figures    
OL,11,Fobtained through a Freedom of          
OL,12,FInformation (FOI) request.             
OL,14,FThe UK's Department for Business,      
OL,15,FInnovation, Science and Trade confirmed
OL,16,Fthat "the government has not spent, nor
OL,17,Fallocated, nor committed any money     
OL,18,Funder the #2.5bn commitment in Wales". 
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
