OL,3,GNEWSANone of UK government's #2.5bn    
OL,4,Asteel package spent in Wales, figures  
OL,5,Ashow                                   
OL,7,FThe FOI was obtained by the Liberal    
OL,8,FDemocrats, whose Welsh leader David    
OL,9,FChadwick said that Welsh Labour MPs    
OL,10,Fneeded to "demand a fair share for     
OL,11,FWelsh steel now, before their own      
OL,12,Fgovernment spends the rest".           
OL,14,FThe UK government said it had "invested
OL,15,Fextensively to secure steelmaking" in  
OL,16,FPort Talbot.                           
